# Cline rules — TodoApp (always-on, keep <20 lines)
Always read AGENTS.md first, then docs/context/contracts.md + the task file in docs/tasks/.
Do not guess REST/SignalR shapes — docs/context/contracts.md is source of truth (code 67026a1, NOT plan/tasks).
After each task: append 1 line to docs/sessions/session-log.md; update docs/context/contracts.md only if wire format changed.
